Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.66,0:00:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.68,0:00:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.06,0:01:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, boss, how long are you going to\Nkeep me held up in this place, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.82,0:01:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got two of our idiots already while\Nwe sat around twiddling our thumbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.98,0:01:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have let me handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.84,0:01:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you should have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.50,0:01:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then, I'll let you go next.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.68,0:01:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll even set the stage for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I expect you to entertain him\Nwith a unique performance of Trix.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.44,0:02:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can be reasoned with.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.36,0:02:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hope the reward is reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.64,0:02:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, are you gonna make him\Ngo at it alone this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.52,0:02:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.43,0:02:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a firm believer\Nthat an audience always
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.22,0:02:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gets more pleasure from\Na drama with a twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a simple formula.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.52,0:02:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The greater the tragedy, the\Ngreater the emotional effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.56,0:02:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm worried, Meryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.16,0:02:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been two whole weeks now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry this is as far\Nas we can travel together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.06,0:02:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.20,0:02:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your job or your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is more important to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.90,0:03:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't explain now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.54,0:03:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I did, you'd be put in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.36,0:03:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's been a lot of fun, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.12,0:03:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash, I wonder how he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.96,0:03:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know him, he's undoubtedly\Ngoofing around in some town somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.60,0:03:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's just fine and dandy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.46,0:03:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.00,0:03:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.88,0:03:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember the guy in the white suit who\Nhad caused the saloon riot the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he apparently turned\Nout to be one of Vash's gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.84,0:03:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.75,0:03:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would explain a lot, including\Nwhy his methods were so dang vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.64,0:03:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess at this point, we should count\Nour blessings if we got off so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.22,0:03:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's a devil in a red coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.26,0:03:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.46,0:03:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, I wish he'd just dropped dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.36,0:03:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you stand there and say\Nsuch awful things about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.14,0:03:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.05,0:03:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, after all, you have no\Nidea what kind of person he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.12,0:03:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you're disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.78,0:04:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, Meryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.96,0:04:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk your own path with\Nyour head held high.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.34,0:04:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have to keep saying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.86,0:04:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Millie? Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.52,0:04:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.56,0:04:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a lot of work ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's stop wasting time. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.26,0:04:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If necessary, we'll follow\Nhim to the ends of the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.20,0:04:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not only our job now, it's\Nbecome our mission to track him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.18,0:04:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, chair, how you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Legato, I am the one that\Nis hunting you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will find you whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:04:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds real cool in\Nmy head, but in reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.28,0:05:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't got a clue as to\Nhow I'm going to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, what am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.10,0:05:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only that, the more time\NI have to think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the more frightening it becomes, and now\Nmy knees are starting to knock together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.72,0:05:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, I actually have to fight this guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.32,0:05:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I possibly win such a\Nbattle or even have a chance to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.30,0:05:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,survive a fight with the guy\Nwho smiles with those evil eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.94,0:05:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The answer is I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.70,0:05:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be slaughtered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.62,0:05:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.53,0:05:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not even funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.45,0:05:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should just back out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.78,0:05:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I should do, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.36,0:05:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, for once I'm right. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right about one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.38,0:05:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.52,0:05:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You change your tune\Nfaster than radio station.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.60,0:05:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, life ought to\Nbe fun after all, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.96,0:05:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.14,0:05:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's super tasty, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.18,0:05:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have another salmon\Nsandwich if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.66,0:05:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Augusta, I'll be waiting\Nfor you in Augusta City.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.26,0:06:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will acknowledge\Nmy request immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do not meet my request, this is\Na sample of what will happen. Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.40,0:06:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.31,0:06:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.92,0:06:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no blood. Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.20,0:06:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you actually know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy, you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.66,0:06:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.30,0:06:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the only one capable of doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.08,0:06:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Legato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.02,0:06:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You called him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.42,0:06:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.54,0:06:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, is he your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.80,0:06:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want me there so bad you\Nwould kill the innocent to get me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.94,0:06:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go there, Legato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.58,0:06:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll face you on your home ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.60,0:06:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.90,0:06:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.81,0:06:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the heck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.42,0:06:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, easy there, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.10,0:06:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, it's Vash the Stampede.\NHe's here. I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.66,0:07:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.70,0:07:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.90,0:07:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's running\Nrampant through Augusta,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.90,0:07:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blasting away with that\Nbig silver gun of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.60,0:07:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.51,0:07:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That crazy bastard's gonna do\Nto Augusta what he did to July.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.04,0:07:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's a good thing we found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, what in the hell could\Nthat man possibly be thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.94,0:07:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.34,0:07:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.36,0:07:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.82,0:07:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,forgive the lack of warning, but I'm\Nafraid it's time for my daily massacre!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.50,0:07:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you don't believe\NI'm the real thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.48,0:07:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take a long look at me\Nand start freaking out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.04,0:07:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Observe my red coat,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.68,0:07:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my lovely blonde locks, And\Nif you're still having doubts,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.42,0:07:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,check out my one hundred\Npercent accurate gunmanship!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.62,0:08:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you people don't want to die today,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.58,0:08:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get at least a hundred miles away\Nfrom this place as fast as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.66,0:08:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then happily ever after!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.26,0:08:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, that's the last of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.36,0:08:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't that nihilistic jerk\Nhave picked a better location?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.08,0:08:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used up all my energy\Njust chasing people out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.64,0:08:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm poofed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.10,0:08:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.96,0:08:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It reminds me of the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's not right here unless you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.30,0:08:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.52,0:08:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you like my decorations?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.18,0:08:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this game, losers don't get to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.02,0:08:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.98,0:09:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the fifth gung-ho gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.34,0:09:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is E. G. Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.28,0:09:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you kill them or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.14,0:09:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, you are a noisy one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.64,0:09:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I did, chicken shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.42,0:09:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't seem to want to kill anyone, so\Nsomeone had to step up and cover your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.40,0:09:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, Blondie, you\Nhave fallen into my court.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.24,0:09:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gee, aren't you the poetic one?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.56,0:09:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me that I only have\Ntwo choices, to die or to let die?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.60,0:09:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, cowboy, don't be such a drama queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.52,0:09:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only one more has to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.68,0:09:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stand there like a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.50,0:09:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as I take you\Ndown, it'll all be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:41.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.44,0:09:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bastard is trying\Nto cut in on my action.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.06,0:10:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I have chosen to dispatch\Nmy saber at this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.76,0:10:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the situation may have\Nescalated into a real problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would have at least been knocked\Nsenseless by your humanoid typhoon there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.80,0:10:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.71,0:10:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now it's getting interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.52,0:10:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're the favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.72,0:10:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.24,0:10:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive my lack of manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.72,0:10:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the ninth gung-ho gun of Jigenzan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.18,0:10:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trained by the masters of the Ito\Nschool, I am Raidei, the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.74,0:10:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hold no personal grudge against you, but\NI wish to engage you in Shi 'ai. Shi 'ai?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.59,0:10:32.58,Dialogue2,Unknown,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(360,42)}"Death match"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.76,0:10:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't read that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.64,0:10:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you cannot mean Japanese, then I'll\Ngive you an abbreviated explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.36,0:10:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.00,0:10:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's in it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You playing along with\NLegato's little farce as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.90,0:10:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would happily walk the path\Nof carnage a thousand times,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a thousand times again\Nfor the mastery of Bushido.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.84,0:10:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.75,0:10:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because there is something only visible\Nwhen you stand before the Deathly Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.90,0:11:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe you have seen\Nthis too, have you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.40,0:11:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen anything there at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.32,0:11:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except my own fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.19,0:11:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that I think you should experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.66,0:11:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.57,0:11:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That mental state!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.90,0:11:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.44,0:11:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my job to slice and dice this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.08,0:11:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.99,0:11:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would appear you simply did not hear\Nwhat I told you just a few minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.88,0:11:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.79,0:11:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.24,0:11:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.40,0:11:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your match was quite\Nover before my arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.56,0:11:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fast gunmanship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.22,0:11:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Words fail to describe its greatness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man was never an\Nopponent to be humbled by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.74,0:11:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were completely out of your lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.34,0:11:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your turn is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.88,0:11:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take heart in the fact that you may\Nhave served to amuse him for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.24,0:11:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You... slime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.14,0:12:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, let it burn within you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel it build and fester.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.88,0:12:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angry aura released through your\Nevery pore, my knees are shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That alone makes my trip\Nto this place worthwhile.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.26,0:12:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is the source of my greatest pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.12,0:12:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, I'm in your debt. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.10,0:12:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that all you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.40,0:12:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause me real harm!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never heard of warrior's compassion?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.04,0:12:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hit you in any\Nway if it'd kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:12:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite the arrogance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.96,0:13:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A real eyesore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.06,0:13:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It blurs my path to spiritual awareness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.28,0:13:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friend, people don't\Nchange their ways that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You actually think we're People, absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.80,0:13:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and I are men, yet not of\Nwe are dark, diabolical puppets.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.20,0:13:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What we are—our demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.52,0:13:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,demons
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.30,0:13:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.98,0:13:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but it's\Ndefinitely not a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.38,0:13:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.29,0:13:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think it's Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.40,0:13:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.46,0:13:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.37,0:13:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Meryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.72,0:13:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.82,0:13:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't this time. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.58,0:13:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash said it's too big for us to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.56,0:13:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is seriously dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am well aware of the danger, Millie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.30,0:13:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.00,0:13:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you stop wasting time\Nhere and fight me like you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.74,0:13:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.78,0:13:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that was a huge shockwave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:14:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.30,0:14:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing I can't dodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.06,0:14:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you make those bullets hit me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.98,0:14:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.66,0:14:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, knowledge boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.96,0:14:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compassion?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.87,0:14:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the heat of battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a gross disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.24,0:14:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.94,0:14:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.20,0:14:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this all you amount to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.98,0:14:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see absolutely nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.12,0:14:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.22,0:14:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least give me an answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you're seeing\Nright now at this moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.50,0:14:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:15:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you intend to die, Vash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.50,0:15:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time has come for you to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.54,0:15:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.60,0:15:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.76,0:15:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something only you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.34,0:15:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use it! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.44,0:15:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.35,0:15:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.27,0:15:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.18,0:15:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot believe he is\Nbegging for his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.12,0:15:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.08,0:15:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.96,0:15:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not... the light!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.84,0:15:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.64,0:15:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.55,0:15:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bash meant what he said!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.56,0:15:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at this place! Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.06,0:16:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've gotta find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meryl, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.36,0:16:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.46,0:16:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me right now, Millie!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.30,0:16:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.94,0:16:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Millie, I want to go back! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.74,0:16:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to go back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.94,0:16:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this strange phenomenon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.08,0:16:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this some sort of\Ntwisted Christian science?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.42,0:16:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.52,0:16:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.96,0:16:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.20,0:16:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this indescribable horror\Ncoursing through my entire body?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.00,0:16:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.48,0:17:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this the moment I have been seeking?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.06,0:17:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I really reach spiritual awareness?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.56,0:17:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.58,0:17:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.52,0:17:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.50,0:17:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run away now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.88,0:17:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.96,0:17:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.64,0:17:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.94,0:17:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.70,0:17:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Stop it! Please! Help me! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.34,0:17:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.34,0:17:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that horrific light?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.46,0:18:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he the one creating that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.10,0:18:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.44,0:18:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is the second time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.38,0:18:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first was a great explosion,\Nwhich took July 23 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.66,0:18:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Billy, please let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.38,0:18:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.74,0:18:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.12,0:18:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, if you die,\Nyou'll never see him again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.48,0:18:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hole in the moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.08,0:19:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I felt... a terror!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.86,0:19:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only you can survive something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.64,0:19:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.55,0:19:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.98,0:19:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to Vash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.76,0:19:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we act quickly, we may be able to defeat\Nthat man, that horrible devil of a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.84,0:19:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stampede is too\Ndangerous to be left alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.70,0:19:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you help me, we can do this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.76,0:19:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.67,0:19:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.59,0:19:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.26,0:19:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and I are...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.22,0:19:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we could...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.13,0:19:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.18,0:19:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, nobody died from the blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.28,0:19:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But just look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.10,0:19:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another town in rubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.12,0:19:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this the path you have chosen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.94,0:20:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.38,0:20:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.62,0:20:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear the rumor about how the\Nhumanoid typhoon showed up on Augusta?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.38,0:20:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.66,0:20:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, they say he managed to\Ndestroy the entire city all by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.84,0:20:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First July, and now Augusta.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.36,0:20:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the hell can\Nthat maniac be thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.66,0:20:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's completely out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.86,0:20:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just getting out of hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.30,0:20:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bounty on his head\Nwill only get bigger now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.82,0:20:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who's to say won't destroy\Nour town and any others?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.06,0:20:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to believe it's all his\Nfault that we're stuck on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.52,0:20:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention all of the other\Ncrap I've heard about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.16,0:20:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.38,0:20:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're saying now that he's also solely\Nresponsible for that big hole in the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.22,0:20:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes me sick just to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.46,0:20:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you, nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.37,0:20:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't a man alive who\Ncan pull off a stunt like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:52.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool your jets, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just telling you what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.06,0:20:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not making it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.74,0:20:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.72,0:21:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should just be thankful\Nthat we're all still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you said it
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.76,0:21:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meryl we received a letter\Nfrom the main office.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.74,0:21:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.70,0:21:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the correspondence\Ncertainly is slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.08,0:21:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been sitting here\Nwaiting for two weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.80,0:21:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meryl Stryfe and Millie Thompson are to\Nreturn to the main office immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.30,0:21:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Furthermore,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.48,0:21:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in a conference held the other day,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.40,0:21:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was decided that Vash the\NStampede will be designated?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.98,0:21:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as mankind's first\Nofficial human disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.14,0:21:42.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From this day forward, no matter\Nwhat kind of damage he causes,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.10,0:21:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Bernardelli Insurance\NSociety will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.10,0:21:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.40,0:21:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.98,0:21:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,...uninvolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.70,0:22:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.70,0:22:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.54,0:22:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do they think will change\Nby making this decision now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.36,0:22:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meryl...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.40,0:22:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.31,0:22:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash, you're a jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.76,0:22:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made Meryl cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.96,0:22:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never, ever forgive you for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.88,0:22:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blue sky, in the middle of the\Nsky, the wind is in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.02,0:22:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light of the sky, as\Nyou can see, as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.06,0:23:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that it's been released.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.06,0:23:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.38,0:23:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's nothing left for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.06,0:23:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.44,0:23:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,left for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.80,0:23:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how much I can find a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.71,0:23:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the first time\NI'm going to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.63,0:23:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a little bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.98,0:23:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how much I can find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.20,0:23:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how much I can find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.32,0:23:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.23,0:23:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.86,0:23:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.77,0:24:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much I can find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.82,0:24:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem told me that someone\Nshe loved died on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.96,0:24:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She told me she boarded this\Nship so she could start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.90,0:24:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does it feel like to\Nhave someone you love die?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.64,0:24:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried thinking of what it\Nwould be like if Rem died.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.22,0:24:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I did, hot water came out of my eyes\Nand it wouldn't stop for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.38,0:24:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem, I'll always be there for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.18,0:24:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't leave you alone.

